---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base page="home" title="Wizardlenz XR Studio | XR programs, XR for business and original games" description="Wizardlenz XR Studio teaches XR at colleges and universities, builds immersive experiences for business, and makes its own games and tools. See the magic! Be the magic!">
<div class="view" id="v-home" data-view="home">
<!-- ================= REALITY ================= -->
<section class="sc" id="reality" data-stage="0" aria-labelledby="heroH">
  <canvas id="scCanvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="wrap sc-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="slogan"><span class="orbdot"></span>See the magic! Be the magic!</p>
      <h1 id="heroH">We create immersive worlds.</h1>
      <p class="h1-sub">Our own, yours, and the next generation's.</p>
      <p class="lead">Wizardlenz XR Studio runs VR, AR and AI programs for colleges, builds immersive experiences for businesses, and makes its own games and tools.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary mag" href="/academy/" data-portal="Academy">XR programs for institutions</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost mag" href="/studio/" data-portal="Studio">Build with us</a>
      </div>
      <a class="quiet-link" href="/originals/" data-portal="Originals">See our games and tools →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="sc-slot" id="scSlot">
      <img id="scImg" src="/img/emblem.png" alt="Wizardlenz XR Studio emblem" width="720" height="585">
      <button type="button" class="sc-cast" id="scCast">Cast it again</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="proof" aria-label="Proof">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="counts">
      <div class="count"><b data-count="1200" data-suffix="+">1,200+</b><span>Students trained</span></div>
      <div class="count"><b data-count="25" data-suffix="+">25+</b><span>Workshops conducted</span></div>
      <div class="count"><b data-count="20" data-suffix="+">20+</b><span>Happy clients</span></div>
      <div class="count"><b data-count="70" data-suffix="+">70+</b><span>Prototypes developed</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="trusted" aria-labelledby="trH">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Trusted by</p>
    <h2 class="h2" id="trH" style="max-width:26ch"></h2>
    <p class="lead">Every pin is a city where we've taught or built. Tap a city to see who we worked with there.</p>
    <div class="pills tpills" id="tPills" role="group" aria-label="Choose a city"></div>
    <div class="tbloom-stage"><svg id="tMap" role="img" aria-label="Map of India with a pin in each city where Wizardlenz has worked"></svg></div>
    <div class="tnames" id="tNames"></div>
    <p class="chip-label" style="margin-top:28px">Recognised by</p>
    <div class="chips"><span class="chip">StartupTN</span><span class="chip">MSME</span><span class="chip">Startup India</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="pathsH">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Choose your path</p>
    <h2 class="h2" id="pathsH" data-decode>Three ways to work with us.</h2>
    <div class="doors">
      <a class="door primary tilt" href="/academy/" data-portal="Academy"><span class="who">For institutions</span><h3>Bring XR programs to your campus</h3><p>Workshops, bootcamps, semester courses, faculty programs and in-plant training, planned around your department and dates.</p><span class="go">Plan your program →</span></a>
      <a class="door tilt" href="/studio/" data-portal="Studio"><span class="who">For businesses</span><h3>Build XR for your business</h3><p>Training simulations, virtual showrooms, AR product views and immersive events, from first prototype to launch.</p><span class="go">Book a discovery call →</span></a>
      <a class="door tilt" href="/originals/" data-portal="Originals"><span class="who">Players and developers</span><h3>Play our games, use our tools</h3><p>Our PC game on itch.io, XR games in the lab, and ImmersiTest, a free testing tool for XR developers.</p><span class="go">Explore Originals →</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="h-academy" aria-labelledby="acadH">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="acad-top">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Academy</p>
        <h2 class="h2" id="acadH" data-decode>XR programs, shaped around your department.</h2>
        <p class="lead">We plan every program with your department, around your students, your lab and your dates. Students build real projects and earn certificates.</p>
        <div class="cta-row"><a class="btn btn-primary mag" href="/academy/#planner" data-portal="Academy">Plan your program</a><a class="btn btn-ghost mag" href="/academy/" data-portal="Academy">Explore the Academy</a></div>
      </div>
      <figure class="plens">
        <img src="/img/woxsen-2026.jpg" alt="The Wizardlenz team with participants of a 2026 program at Woxsen University; one is wearing a VR headset." width="1040" height="780">
        <div class="xr" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="/img/woxsen-2026.jpg" alt="">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 1040 780" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" font-family="JetBrains Mono, ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="19" font-weight="600">
              <g fill="none" stroke="#22D3EE" stroke-width="2.5">
                <rect x="74" y="16" width="490" height="368" rx="6" stroke-dasharray="12 9"/>
                <circle cx="320" cy="190" r="98"/>
                <ellipse cx="320" cy="190" rx="98" ry="32"/>
                <ellipse cx="320" cy="190" rx="40" ry="98"/>
                <ellipse cx="320" cy="190" rx="78" ry="98"/>
                <path d="M222 190h196M320 92v196"/>
                <ellipse cx="320" cy="190" rx="150" ry="42" stroke="#A78BFA" transform="rotate(-14 320 190)"/>
                <rect x="404" y="246" width="60" height="36" rx="13" stroke="#A78BFA" stroke-width="3.5"/>
                <path d="M500 194 L452 244" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"/>
                <rect x="98" y="434" width="94" height="62" rx="5"/>
                <path d="M150 432 L150 418" stroke-width="2"/>
                <rect x="898" y="638" width="140" height="132" rx="8" stroke-dasharray="10 7"/>
                <path d="M900 600 L930 636" stroke-width="2"/>
                <path d="M930 236l36-20 36 20v40l-36 20-36-20z M930 236l36 20 36-20 M966 256v40" stroke="#A78BFA"/>
              </g>
              <g>
                <rect x="96" y="32" width="282" height="36" rx="9" fill="#22D3EE"/><text x="110" y="57" fill="#061018">LESSON · SPATIAL UI</text>
                <rect x="232" y="304" width="196" height="36" rx="9" fill="#22D3EE"/><text x="246" y="329" fill="#061018">3D MODEL · LIVE</text>
                <rect x="470" y="158" width="320" height="36" rx="9" fill="#A78BFA"/><text x="484" y="183" fill="#120F33">VR HEADSET · HANDS ON</text>
                <rect x="40" y="384" width="236" height="36" rx="9" fill="#22D3EE"/><text x="54" y="409" fill="#061018">UNITY BUILD · RUN</text>
                <rect x="744" y="564" width="270" height="36" rx="9" fill="#22D3EE"/><text x="758" y="589" fill="#061018">HEADSETS · CHARGED</text>
                <rect x="860" y="308" width="166" height="36" rx="9" fill="#A78BFA"/><text x="874" y="333" fill="#120F33">AR POSTER</text>
              </g>
            </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="lens-ring" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <span class="stage-chip">Through the lens · Woxsen University, 2026</span>
        <figcaption class="stage-hint">Move over the photo to see the room in XR</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="h-gallery" aria-labelledby="galH">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Gallery</p>
    <h2 class="h2" id="galH" data-decode>Moments from our programs.</h2>
    <p class="lead">A new album after every program, posted by our team. Scroll or drag to spin.</p>
    <div class="ring-stage" id="ringStage">
      <div class="ring" id="ring">
        <a class="album" href="/gallery/" style="--h:265"><div class="art">[Album cover photo]</div><div class="meta"><b>Introduction to Extended Reality</b><span>Woxsen University · Semester course</span></div></a>
        <a class="album" href="/gallery/" style="--h:190"><div class="art">[Album cover photo]</div><div class="meta"><b>XR: The Horizon of the Digitalization</b><span>IEEE CS · TCE · Workshop</span></div></a>
        <a class="album" href="/gallery/" style="--h:300"><div class="art">[Album cover photo]</div><div class="meta"><b>[Program name]</b><span>[Institution] · [Type]</span></div></a>
        <a class="album" href="/gallery/" style="--h:220"><div class="art">[Album cover photo]</div><div class="meta"><b>[Program name]</b><span>[Institution] · [Type]</span></div></a>
        <a class="album" href="/gallery/" style="--h:330"><div class="art">[Album cover photo]</div><div class="meta"><b>[Program name]</b><span>[Institution] · [Type]</span></div></a>
        <a class="album" href="/gallery/" style="--h:170"><div class="art">[Album cover photo]</div><div class="meta"><b>[Program name]</b><span>[Institution] · [Type]</span></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ring-ctrl">
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="/gallery/" data-portal="Gallery">Open the full gallery</a>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:10px">
        <button type="button" class="icon-btn" id="ringPrev" aria-label="Previous album"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 6l-6 6 6 6"/></svg></button>
        <button type="button" class="icon-btn" id="ringNext" aria-label="Next album"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= AR ================= -->
<section id="h-studio" data-stage="1" aria-labelledby="studioH">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Studio</p>
    <h2 class="h2" id="studioH" data-decode>XR that does a real job for your business.</h2>
    <div class="svcs">
      <div class="svc spot"><canvas class="svcv" data-svc="train" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" class="draw" d="M6 30c0-8 8-12 18-12s18 4 18 12v4H6z"/><path pathLength="1" class="draw" d="M14 22v-6a10 10 0 0 1 20 0v6M18 34v6m12-6v6"/></svg><h3>Training simulations</h3><p>Practise risky or costly tasks safely in VR, as often as your team needs.</p></div>
      <div class="svc spot"><canvas class="svcv" data-svc="show" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" class="draw" d="M24 6l16 9v18l-16 9-16-9V15z"/><path pathLength="1" class="draw" d="M24 24l16-9M24 24v18M24 24L8 15"/></svg><h3>Virtual showrooms and AR product views</h3><p>Let customers explore your products at full scale, on any phone.</p></div>
      <div class="svc spot"><canvas class="svcv" data-svc="event" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" class="draw" d="M6 18h36v14a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-8l-4-5h-4l-4 5h-8a4 4 0 0 1-4-4z"/><path pathLength="1" class="draw" d="M14 26h4m12 0h4M24 6v6"/></svg><h3>Immersive events</h3><p>XR experiences with on-site support for launches, expos and campus fests.</p></div>
      <div class="svc spot"><canvas class="svcv" data-svc="ai" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" class="draw" d="M12 17h24a7 7 0 0 1 7 7v6a4 4 0 0 1-7 2.5L33 29H15l-3 2.5A4 4 0 0 1 5 30v-6a7 7 0 0 1 7-7z"/><path pathLength="1" class="draw" d="M16 21.5v6M13 24.5h6M31 23h.01M35 26h.01"/></svg><h3>XR games and AI experiences</h3><p>Custom games and AI-powered features for headsets, phones and PCs: game-based learning, AI characters and smart assistants.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="cta-row"><a class="btn btn-primary mag" href="/studio/" data-portal="Studio">Explore the Studio</a><a class="btn btn-ghost mag" href="/contact/" data-portal="Contact">Book a discovery call</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= MR ================= -->
<section id="h-originals" data-stage="2" aria-labelledby="origH">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Originals</p>
    <h2 class="h2" id="origH" data-decode>We build our own worlds, too.</h2>
    <p class="lead">Games and tools made in-house: the clearest proof of what our team can ship.</p>
    <article class="game tilt">
      <div class="trailer" data-yt="PYfeslTWcpM" style="background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(8,7,26,.35),rgba(8,7,26,.55)),url('https://i.ytimg.com/vi/PYfeslTWcpM/hqdefault.jpg');background-size:cover;background-position:center"><button type="button" class="play" aria-label="Play The Narrator Lies trailer"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z" fill="#061018"/></svg></button><small>Play the trailer</small><noscript><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PYfeslTWcpM" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch on YouTube</a></noscript></div>
      <div class="info">
        <div class="badges"><span class="badge live">Windows · free on itch.io</span><span class="badge">Android · coming soon</span></div>
        <h3>The Narrator Lies</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--violet-soft);font-weight:600">A platformer where the hints are the trap.</p><p>Guide One Eye through 50 short, sharp levels while a friendly narrator tells you where it's safe. He's lying. Usually.</p><div class="chips" style="margin-top:14px"><span class="chip" style="font-size:13px;padding:5px 11px">50 levels · 5 chapters</span><span class="chip" style="font-size:13px;padding:5px 11px">Keyboard and controller</span><span class="chip" style="font-size:13px;padding:5px 11px">Free · no ads</span></div>
        <div class="cta-row" style="margin-top:22px"><a class="btn btn-primary mag" href="https://wizardlenz-xr-studio.itch.io/the-narrator-lies" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Download on itch.io</a><a class="btn btn-ghost mag" href="/originals/">Notify me on Android</a></div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <div class="cta-row"><a class="btn btn-primary mag" href="/originals/" data-portal="Originals">See all Originals</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= VR ================= -->
<section id="h-about" data-stage="3" aria-label="About Wizardlenz">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="founder" style="margin-top:0">
      <div class="portrait"><img src="/img/nirmal-founder.webp" alt="Nirmal Jeyavelraj, Founder and Director of Wizardlenz XR Studio" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">From the founder</p>
        <blockquote>"We are here not just to build products but to create possibilities."</blockquote>
        <p style="margin:22px 0 0;font-weight:700;font-size:18px">Nirmal Jeyavelraj</p>
        <p style="margin:2px 0 0;color:var(--mute)">Founder &amp; Director</p>
        <a class="quiet-link" href="/about/" data-portal="About">More about us →</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quotes">
      <p class="eyebrow">Partners</p>
      <h2 class="h2" data-decode>What our partners say.</h2>
      <div class="qgrid">
        <figure class="q"><blockquote>"The Wizardlenz team's expertise in cutting-edge immersive technologies enabled students to develop innovative projects, from games to apps."</blockquote><figcaption><b>Kamalanarayanan K</b><span>Program Director, Communication Design, Woxsen University</span></figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="q"><blockquote>"The real-world examples and live demonstrations effectively illustrated the potential of AR in various industries."</blockquote><figcaption><b>Dr K Indira</b><span>Assistant Professor, CSE, Thiagarajar College of Engineering</span></figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="q"><blockquote>"The Wizardlenz team was very knowledgeable, explained the concepts clearly and gave detailed support after the sessions."</blockquote><figcaption><b>B Vikranth</b><span>Corporate Head, PERI Group</span></figcaption></figure>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="band" style="margin-top:96px">
      <div><h2 class="h2" style="margin:0">Let's talk XR.</h2><p class="lead" style="font-size:17px">A program for your institution, a project for your business, or a partnership.</p></div>
      <a class="btn btn-primary mag" href="/contact/" data-portal="Contact">Start a conversation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</div>
</Base>
